idas y flexibles que se adaptan a su bicicleta y a sus necesidades.\n    </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-12 pt8 pb8" data-name="Feature">\n                            <i class="s_showcase_icon fa fa-heart-o me-auto rounded float-start bg-o-color-2" role="img"/>\n                            <div class="d-flex flex-column">\n                                <h3 class="s_showcase_title h5-fs">\n        La seguridad primero\n    </h3>\n                                <p>\n        Aplicamos revisiones cuidadosas en cada servicio para proteger su bicicleta y garantizar un funcionamiento seguro y confiable.\n    </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class="col-12 pt8 pb8" style="text-align: right;">\n                            <div class="s_hr pt0 pb16" data-snippet="s_hr">\n                                <hr class="w-100 mx-auto"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <a href="#">\n        Reservar cita\n    </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class="o_snippet_mobile_invisible d-lg-block d-none col-lg-5 offset-lg-1">\n                    <img src="/web/image/website.s_showcase_default_image" class="img img-fluid ms-auto rounded float-end shadow" alt="" loading="lazy"/>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section><section class="s_image_title o_cc o_cc5 oe_img_bg pt144 pb144" style="background-image: url('/web/image/website.s_image_title_default_image'); background-position: 50% 70%;" data-oe-shape-data="{'shape':'html_builder/Bold/14','colors':{'c1':'o-color-4','c5':'o-color-4'}}" data-snippet="s_image_title">\n        <div class="o_we_bg_filter bg-black-50"/>\n        <div class="o_we_shape o_html_builder_Bold_14" style="background-image: url('/html_editor/shape/html_builder/Bold/14.svg?c1=o-co