2004	16	2003	1	1	new_page_template_landing_s_showcase	\N	website.new_page_template_landing_s_showcase	qweb	website/views/new_page_template_templates.xml	primary	{"en_US": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_s_showcase\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//h3\\" position=\\"replace\\" mode=\\"inner\\">\\n        Intuitive Touch Controls\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\" mode=\\"inner\\">\\n        Secure and Comfortable Fit\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\" mode=\\"inner\\">\\n        On-the-Go Charging\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>Adjust volume, skip tracks, answer calls, and activate voice assistants with a simple tap, keeping your hands free and your focus on what matters most.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>EchoTunes comes with customizable ear tip sizes that provide a secure and comfortable fit.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>The compact charging case offers convenient on-the-go charging with a battery life that lasts up to 17h, you can enjoy your favorite tunes without interruption.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_landing_s_showcase</attribute></xpath></data>", "es_ES": "<data inherit_id=\\"website.new_page_template_s_showcase\\" primary=\\"True\\">\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//h3\\" position=\\"replace\\" mode=\\"inner\\">\\n        Controles táctiles intuitivos\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\" mode=\\"inner\\">\\n        Ajuste cómodo y seguro\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//h3)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\" mode=\\"inner\\">\\n        Carga sobre la marcha\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"//p\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>Ajuste el volumen, omita canciones, responda llamadas y active el asistente de voz, ¡todo con solo pulsar un botón! De este modo tendrá las manos libres y podrá concentrarse en lo que más le importa.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[2]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>EchoTunes incluye almohadillas personalizables que proporcionan un ajuste seguro y cómodo.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n    <xpath expr=\\"(//p)[3]\\" position=\\"replace\\">\\n        <p>El estuche de carga compacto ofrece una carga práctica en cualquier lugar con una duración de la batería de hasta 17 h, para que pueda disfrutar de sus canciones favoritas sin interrupciones.</p>\\n    </xpath>\\n<xpath expr=\\".\\" position=\\"attributes\\"><attribute name=\\"t-name\\">website.new_page_template_landing_s_showcase</attribute></xpath></data>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<data inherit_id="website.new_page_template_s_showcase" primary="True">\n    <xpath expr="//h3" position="replace" mode="inner">\n        Intuitive Touch Controls\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3)[2]" position="replace" mode="inner">\n        Secure and Comfortable Fit\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//h3)[3]" position="replace" mode="inner">\n        On-the-Go Charging\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="//p" position="replace">\n        <p>Adjust volume, skip tracks, answer calls, and activate voice assistants with a simple tap, keeping your hands free and your focus on what matters most.</p>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//p)[2]" position="replace">\n        <p>EchoTunes comes with customizable ear tip sizes that provide a secure and comfortable fit.</p>\n    </xpath>\n    <xpath expr="(//p)[3]" position="replace">\n        <p>The compact charging case offers convenient on-the-go charging with a battery life that lasts up to 17h, you can enjoy your favorite tunes without interruption.</p>\n    </xpath>\n<xpath expr="." position="attributes"><attribute name="t-name">website.new_page_template_landing_s_showcase</attribute></xpath></data>\n\n	f	t	2026-11-20 12:35