">\\n                                                        <div class=\\"modal-content\\">\\n                                                            <div class=\\"modal-header\\">\\n                                                                <h5 class=\\"modal-title\\">Título modal</h5>\\n                                                                <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn-close\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\" aria-label=\\"Cerrar\\"/>\\n                                                            </div>\\n                                                            <div class=\\"modal-body\\">\\n                                                                <p>Este es un párrafo. Ambitioni dedisse scripsisse iudicaretur. Nihilne te nocturnum praesidium Palati, nihil urbis vigiliae. Unam incolunt Belgae, aliam Aquitani, tertiam. Integer legentibus erat a ante historiarum dapibus. Phasellus laoreet lorem vel dolor tempus vehicula.</p>\\n                                                            </div>\\n                                                            <div class=\\"modal-footer\\">\\n                                                                <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-light\\" data-bs-dismiss=\\"modal\\">Cerrar</button>\\n                                                                <button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"btn btn-primary\\">Guardar cambios</button>\\n                                                            </div>\\n                                                        </div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                            </section>\\n                            <hr class=\\"my-5\\"/>\\n                            <section class=\\"pb-5\\">\\n                                <div class=\\"container\\">\\n                                    <h1>Utilidades y tipografía</h1>\\n                                    <div class=\\"row\\">\\n                                        <div class=\\"col-md\\">\\n                                            <div class=\\"row g-0\\">\\n                                                <t t-foreach=\\"odoo_theme_colors\\" t-as=\\"color\\">\\n                                                    <div t-attf-class=\\"col-auto bg-#{color[0]}\\">\\n                                                        <div class=\\"py-1 px-3\\"><t t-out=\\"color[1]\\"/></div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </t>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row g-0 mt-2\\">\\n                                                <t t-foreach=\\"bs_theme_colors\\" t-as=\\"color\\">\\n                                                    <div t-attf-class=\\"col-auto text-bg-#{color[0]}\\">\\n                                                        <div class=\\"py-1 px-3\\"><t t-out=\\"color[1]\\"/></div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </t>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row g-0 mt-2\\">\\n                                                <t t-foreach=\\"bs_gray_colors\\" t-as=\\"color\\">\\n                                                    <div t-attf-class=\\"col-auto bg-#{color[0]}\\">\\n                                                        <div class=\\"py-1 px-3\\"><t t-out=\\"color[1]\\"/></div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </t>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row g-0 mt-4\\">\\n                                                <t t-foreach=\\"odoo_theme_colors\\" t-as=\\"color\\">\\n                                                    <div t-attf-class=\\"col-auto text-#{color[0]}\\">\\n                                                        <div class=\\"py-1 px-3\\"><t t-out=\\"color[1]\\"/></div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </t>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row g-0 mt-2\\">\\n                                                <t t-foreach=\\"bs_theme_colors\\" t-as=\\"color\\">\\n                                                    <div t-attf-class=\\"col-auto text-#{color[0]}\\">\\n                                                        <div class=\\"py-1 px-3\\"><t t-out=\\"color[1]\\"/></div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </t>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row g-0 mt-2\\">\\n                                                <t t-foreach=\\"bs_gray_colors\\" t-as=\\"color\\">\\n                                                    <div t-attf-class=\\"col-auto text-#{color[0]}\\">\\n                                                        <div class=\\"py-1 px-3\\"><t t-out=\\"color[1]\\"/></div>\\n                                                    </div>\\n                                                </t>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row gap-4 mt-4\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"col p-4 text-center shadow-sm \\">\\n                                                    <p class=\\"mb-1\\">Sombreado pequeño</p>\\n                                                    <small class=\\"text-muted\\">(sombreado-sm)</small>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col p-4 text-center shadow \\">\\n                                                    <p class=\\"mb-1\\">Sombreado medio</p>\\n                                                    <small class=\\"text-muted\\">(sombreado)</small>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col p-4 text-center shadow-lg \\">\\n                                                    <p class=\\"mb-1\\">Sombreado grande</p>\\n                                                    <small class=\\"text-muted\\">(sombreado-lg)</small>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row gap-4 mt-4\\">\\n                                                <div class=\\"col p-4 border text-center rounded-0\\">\\n                                                    <p class=\\"mb-1\\">Radio del borde ninguno</p>\\n                                                    <small class=\\"text-muted\\">(redondeado-0)</small>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col p-4 border text-center rounded-1\\">\\n                                                    <p class=\\"mb-1\\">Radio del borde pequeño</p>\\n                                                    <small class=\\"text-muted\\">(redondeado-1)</small>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col p-4 border text-center rounded-2\\">\\n                                                    <p class=\\"mb-1\\">Radio del borde mediano</p>\\n                                                    <small class=\\"text-muted\\">(redondeado-2)</small>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                                <div class=\\"col p-4 border text-center rounded-3\\">\\n                                                    <p class=\\"mb-1\\">Radio del borde grande</p>\\n                                                    <small class=\\"text-muted\\">(redondeado-3)</small>\\n                                                </div>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                            <div class=\\"row mt-2\\">\\n                                                <p class=\\"display-1\\">Pantalla 1</p>\\n                                                <p class=\\"display-2\\">Pantalla 2</p>\\n                                                <p class=\\"display-3\\">Pantalla 3</p>\\n                                                <p class=\\"display-4\\">Pantalla 4</p>\\n                                                <p class=\\"display-5\\">Pantalla 5</p>\\n                                                <p class=\\"display-6\\">Pantalla 6</p>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </div>\\n                                        <div class=\\"col-md-auto\\">\\n                                            <h1>Título 1</h1>\\n                                            <h2>Título 2</h2>\\n                                            <h3>Título 3</h3>\\n                                            <h4>Título 4</h4>\\n                                            <h5>Título 5</h5>\\n                                            <h6>Título 6</h6>\\n                                            <p class=\\"lead\\">Texto principal</p>\\n                                            <p>Párrafo con texto <strong>en negritas</strong>, <span class=\\"text-muted\\">silenciado</span> y <em>en cursiva</em></p>\\n                                         